{"seq":3,"slug":"global-search-workflows","title":"全局搜索工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/modern-cli-ecosystem/navigation-and-search/global-search-workflows","wordCount":596,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"全局搜索工作流\">全局搜索工作流</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>单独使用 fd、ripgrep 或 fzf 已经很强大，但将它们组合起来能构建出超越任何单一工具能力上限的搜索体验。本文设计三种核心搜索工作流：交互式代码搜索（rg + fzf 实时重载）、文件名搜索（fd + fzf 预览）、以及多级筛选管道。这些工作流覆盖了日常开发中 95% 的搜索场景，且全部可通过 shell 函数一键触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"搜索场景分类\">搜索场景分类</h3><p>开发者的搜索需求可以分为三个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>工具组合</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>知道文件名片段</td>\n<td>fd + fzf</td>\n<td><code>Ctrl+T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>知道代码内容片段</td>\n<td>rg + fzf reload</td>\n<td>自定义函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>模糊记忆，需要浏览</td>\n<td>fd/rg + fzf preview + bat</td>\n<td>多阶段管道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据流架构\">数据流架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Data Sources&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;fd: file names&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;rg: file contents&quot;]&#10;        A3[&quot;git: commits/branches&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Interactive Filter&quot;&#10;        B[&quot;fzf: fuzzy selection&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Preview&quot;&#10;        C1[&quot;bat: syntax highlight&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;eza: directory tree&quot;]&#10;        C3[&quot;git log: commit info&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Actions&quot;&#10;        D1[&quot;vim/code: open file&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;cd: enter directory&quot;]&#10;        D3[&quot;pbcopy: copy to clipboard&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; B&#10;    A2 --&gt; B&#10;    A3 --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C1&#10;    B --&gt; C2&#10;    B --&gt; C3&#10;    B --&gt; D1&#10;    B --&gt; D2&#10;    B --&gt; D3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Data Sources\"\n        A1[\"fd: file names\"]\n        A2[\"rg: file contents\"]\n        A3[\"git: commits/branches\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Interactive Filter\"\n        B[\"fzf: fuzzy selection\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Preview\"\n        C1[\"bat: syntax highlight\"]\n        C2[\"eza: directory tree\"]\n        C3[\"git log: commit info\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Actions\"\n        D1[\"vim/code: open file\"]\n        D2[\"cd: enter directory\"]\n        D3[\"pbcopy: copy to clipboard\"]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; B\n    A2 --&gt; B\n    A3 --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C1\n    B --&gt; C2\n    B --&gt; C3\n    B --&gt; D1\n    B --&gt; D2\n    B --&gt; D3</pre><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"工作流一-交互式代码搜索-live-grep\">工作流一：交互式代码搜索（Live Grep）</h3><p>这是最强大的搜索模式——每个按键都触发 ripgrep 重新搜索，结果实时刷新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 完整的 live grep 函数&#10;rgi() {&#10;  local RG_PREFIX=&quot;rg --column --line-number --no-heading --color=always --smart-case&quot;&#10;  local INITIAL_QUERY=&quot;${*:-}&quot;&#10;  fzf --ansi --disabled --query &quot;$INITIAL_QUERY&quot; \\&#10;      --bind &quot;start:reload:$RG_PREFIX {q}&quot; \\&#10;      --bind &quot;change:reload:sleep 0.05; $RG_PREFIX {q} || true&quot; \\&#10;      --delimiter : \\&#10;      --preview &#39;bat --color=always {1} --highlight-line {2} --line-range {2}:+30&#39; \\&#10;      --preview-window &#39;up,60%,border-bottom,+{2}+3/3,~3&#39; \\&#10;      --bind &#39;enter:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {1} +{2})&#39; \\&#10;      --bind &#39;ctrl-o:execute(code --goto {1}:{2}:{3})&#39; \\&#10;      --header &#39;ENTER=vim | Ctrl-O=VSCode | Ctrl-F=fzf mode | Ctrl-R=rg mode&#39; \\&#10;      --bind &quot;ctrl-f:unbind(change)+clear-query+enable-search&quot; \\&#10;      --bind &quot;ctrl-r:rebind(change)+disable-search+clear-query&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整的 live grep 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rgi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rg --column --line-number --no-heading --color=always --smart-case\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INITIAL_QUERY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*:-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ansi</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --disabled</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --query</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$INITIAL_QUERY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"start:reload:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {q}\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"change:reload:sleep 0.05; </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {q} || true\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --delimiter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always {1} --highlight-line {2} --line-range {2}:+30'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --preview-window</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'up,60%,border-bottom,+{2}+3/3,~3'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'enter:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {1} +{2})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-o:execute(code --goto {1}:{2}:{3})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ENTER=vim | Ctrl-O=VSCode | Ctrl-F=fzf mode | Ctrl-R=rg mode'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ctrl-f:unbind(change)+clear-query+enable-search\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ctrl-r:rebind(change)+disable-search+clear-query\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>rgi useState</code> — 在整个项目中搜索 useState 的使用</li>\n<li><code>rgi &quot;import.*from&quot;</code> — 搜索所有 import 语句</li>\n<li>搜索过程中可以随时用 Ctrl+F 切换到 fzf 模糊模式对结果二次过滤</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"工作流二-文件名搜索-file-finder\">工作流二：文件名搜索（File Finder）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 增强版文件搜索（带智能预览）&#10;ff() {&#10;  local file&#10;  file=$(fd --type f --hidden --follow --exclude .git |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;&#10;      case {} in&#10;        *.md|*.txt|*.py|*.js|*.ts|*.rs|*.go|*.sh|*.yaml|*.yml|*.json|*.toml)&#10;          bat --color=always --line-range :80 {} ;;&#10;        *.png|*.jpg|*.gif)&#10;          echo &quot;Image: $(file {})&quot; ;;&#10;        *)&#10;          file {} ;;&#10;      esac&#10;    &#39; \\&#10;    --preview-window &#39;right:60%&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-/:toggle-preview&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-e:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {})&#39; \\&#10;    --header &#39;ENTER=select | Ctrl-E=edit&#39;&#10;  )&#10;  [ -n &quot;$file&quot; ] &amp;&amp; echo &quot;$file&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 搜索特定类型文件&#10;fft() {&#10;  local ext=&quot;${1:-ts}&quot;&#10;  fd --type f -e &quot;$ext&quot; |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always --line-range :80 {}&#39; \\&#10;        --header &quot;Searching *.$ext files&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 增强版文件搜索（带智能预览）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hidden</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --follow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --exclude</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      case {} in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        *.md|*.txt|*.py|*.js|*.ts|*.rs|*.go|*.sh|*.yaml|*.yml|*.json|*.toml)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          bat --color=always --line-range :80 {} ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        *.png|*.jpg|*.gif)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"Image: $(file {})\" ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          file {} ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      esac</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --preview-window</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'right:60%'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-/:toggle-preview'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-e:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ENTER=select | Ctrl-E=edit'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ] &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 搜索特定类型文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">${1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$ext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always --line-range :80 {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Searching *.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$ext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> files\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工作流三-多级筛选管道\">工作流三：多级筛选管道</h3><p>当搜索范围很大时，使用多级管道逐步缩小范围：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 两阶段搜索：先选目录，再搜内容&#10;deep_search() {&#10;  # Stage 1: 选择搜索目录&#10;  local dir&#10;  dir=$(fd --type d --max-depth 3 |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;eza --tree --level=1 --icons --color=always {}&#39; \\&#10;        --header &#39;Stage 1: Select directory to search in&#39;)&#10;  [ -z &quot;$dir&quot; ] &amp;&amp; return&#10;&#10;  # Stage 2: 在选定目录中搜索内容&#10;  local RG_PREFIX=&quot;rg --column --line-number --no-heading --color=always --smart-case&quot;&#10;  fzf --ansi --disabled \\&#10;      --bind &quot;start:reload:$RG_PREFIX &#39;&#39; $dir&quot; \\&#10;      --bind &quot;change:reload:$RG_PREFIX {q} $dir || true&quot; \\&#10;      --delimiter : \\&#10;      --preview &#39;bat --color=always {1} --highlight-line {2}&#39; \\&#10;      --preview-window &#39;right:60%&#39; \\&#10;      --header &quot;Stage 2: Search in $dir&quot; \\&#10;      --bind &#39;enter:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {1} +{2})&#39;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 搜索并批量操作&#10;search_and_act() {&#10;  local files&#10;  files=$(rg -l &quot;${1:-.}&quot; |&#10;    fzf --multi \\&#10;        --preview &#39;rg --color=always &quot;&#39;&quot;$1&quot;&#39;&quot; {}&#39; \\&#10;        --header &quot;Select files containing: $1&quot;)&#10;  [ -n &quot;$files&quot; ] &amp;&amp; echo &quot;$files&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 两阶段搜索：先选目录，再搜内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shik